Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.21,0:00:09.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Winter arrived at our home\Nin the forest once again.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.79,0:00:13.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,The snow piles up every year.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.79,0:00:18.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,So we step away from our\Nfarming lifestyle for the season.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.67,0:00:23.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Getting through winter with the food and\Nwood we prepared earlier in the year.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.50,0:00:35.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,With our new villages,\Nwe had many more mouths to feed.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.88,0:00:38.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'd worried if we'd prepared enough, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.17,0:00:42.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,We aren't getting through our food stores?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.08,0:00:46.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, well, we're consuming some, of course.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.33,0:00:48.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,But hardly enough.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.42,0:00:52.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're using less than a third\Nof what we estimated.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.08,0:00:55.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,That little?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.71,0:00:58.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,They seem conditioned by\Ntheir circumstances until now...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.29,0:01:04.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,...and so they eat as little as possible.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.63,0:01:06.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Modest living is to be commended,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.58,0:01:09.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,but this level of restraint\Nis an issue of its own.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.50,0:01:13.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,We've told them there is no need\Nfor such moderation, yet still...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.71,0:01:23.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can ask them to eat the meat\Nand vegetables that will spoil otherwise.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.00,0:01:24.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good thinking.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.46,0:01:26.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,That might change their minds.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.75,0:01:28.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll bring word to them now.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.83,0:01:31.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll need to examine our stores.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.17,0:01:33.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mamu?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.04,0:01:35.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.58,0:01:38.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do the nyunyu daphne need anything?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.42,0:01:39.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.83,0:01:45.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,They never need anything!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.17,0:01:46.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,And that's a problem?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.42,0:01:48.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,They don't need food.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.38,0:01:51.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,In tree form, they can withstand the cold.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.54,0:01:52.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Peaceful.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.67,0:01:56.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Every now and then\NI dig them out of the snow, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.17,0:01:57.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.17,0:02:01.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was so happy to be put in charge of them,\Nbut they never need anything from me!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.71,0:02:06.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,You might say their minds are at ease\Nbecause you're around.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.42,0:02:08.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,There is something...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.08,0:02:10.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes? What might it be?!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.92,0:02:14.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,The minotaurs have a request\Nof the nyunyu daphne.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.46,0:02:15.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes?!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.17,0:02:21.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,They would like them to wear clothing\Nwhen they are out.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.21,0:02:22.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Serenity.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.42,0:02:27.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, they sometimes forget to wear\Nclothing when in human form.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.71,0:02:31.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,But don't worry!\NI'll tell them to be more careful!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.46,0:02:33.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that was a simple problem...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.83,0:02:34.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I guess?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.17,0:04:07.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Winter time...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.42,0:04:09.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,calls for winter food!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.67,0:04:15.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,That looks properly steamed!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.54,0:04:17.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I smell rice!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.83,0:04:20.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Making something bizarre again, I imagine?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.67,0:04:22.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,You've got sharp eyes!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.54,0:04:24.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Or noses?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.63,0:04:26.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,That looks like quite a lot.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.13,0:04:29.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Will you be making rice balls?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.29,0:04:31.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wonder how many this will make.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.21,0:04:32.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Actually, this is for...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.96,0:04:36.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear sisters, how wrong you are.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.79,0:04:38.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.46,0:04:41.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,They are clearly preparing\Nto ferment something.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.96,0:04:44.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, no, we're about to do\Nsomething different.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.21,0:04:46.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.83,0:04:49.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,It appears they're making\Nsome new type of food.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.58,0:04:51.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.21,0:04:54.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,With this mortar and pestle,\Nwe will make mochi.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.79,0:04:56.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Never heard of those.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.50,0:04:58.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is the tool in his hand the pestle?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.75,0:05:01.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,And the rice will become mochi?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.63,0:05:05.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Growing rice was quite complicated.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.71,0:05:10.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,But there is such a variety of ways to eat it.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.33,0:05:14.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,This rice is different from the usual.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.75,0:05:16.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's specifically for making mochi.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.29,0:05:18.67,Q8,,0,0,0,,Mochi mochi mochi mochi...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.67,0:05:20.75,Q8,,0,0,0,,Mochi mochi mochi mochi...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.67,0:05:20.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I never knew there were different types.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.08,0:05:21.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.92,0:05:22.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ready.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.75,0:05:24.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.88,0:05:25.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yah!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.79,0:05:26.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.75,0:05:27.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.67,0:05:28.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:28.63,0:05:29.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hah!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.58,0:05:30.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.50,0:05:31.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hrmf!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.46,0:05:32.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.25,0:05:33.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Rmm!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.21,0:05:33.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.96,0:05:37.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was expecting something more spectacular.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.33,0:05:39.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Turns out it's all quite simple.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.83,0:05:40.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hoof...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.83,0:05:43.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Phew, this really tires you out.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.42,0:05:45.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,We simply need to smash it, yes?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.71,0:05:47.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanna try!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:47.25,0:05:48.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Be my guests.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.17,0:05:51.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,But... go easy on it.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.25,0:05:53.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.13,0:05:55.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.63,0:06:08.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Pat.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.79,0:06:10.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Squish squish.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.42,0:06:11.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Squeeze!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.38,0:06:14.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hang on, I don't like the look of that!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.04,0:06:17.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,And so it became something else entirely.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.38,0:06:20.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,So we tried again.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.29,0:06:25.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone who came when they\Nheard the ruckus took turns.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:25.88,0:06:28.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,And eventually it felt\Nmore like the real thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.83,0:06:32.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.54,0:06:34.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.04,0:06:37.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here's a special explosive that's just\Nweak enough that the house won't blow up!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:37.71,0:06:39.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,No explosions, please.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.00,0:06:44.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,After all our troubles, we finally had\Nmochi ready for flavoring.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.21,0:06:47.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sweet and savory in sugary soy sauce.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.88,0:06:49.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,The classic roasted soy powder.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.42,0:06:53.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,And zunda, made with smashed edamame.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.88,0:06:57.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, what an intriguing consistency.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.25,0:06:58.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,So stretchy!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:05.04,0:07:08.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,We also boiled up red beans to make zenzai!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:08.50,0:07:12.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just what you need to warm up on a cold day.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.21,0:07:17.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's hot!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.13,0:07:19.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Burning hot!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.13,0:07:23.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Try some of these if you'd like.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.50,0:07:25.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, kusamochi!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.50,0:07:28.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've added fragrant herbs from the forest.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.08,0:07:31.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, these are excellent.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:31.71,0:07:34.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even better than the mugwort back home.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.54,0:07:36.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you like it.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.92,0:07:40.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Picking herbs is quite a trial.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.67,0:07:43.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,You need to be prepared\Nfor them to fight back.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:43.04,0:07:44.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Herbs can fight?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.58,0:07:47.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's nothing like a rice ball.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.88,0:07:50.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Rice is so peculiar.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.46,0:07:53.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, feasting away, are we?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.21,0:07:55.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Donovan, what's that you've got?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.21,0:07:58.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I heard you were cooking up rice,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.00,0:08:00.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,so I brought something to go with it.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.63,0:08:02.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Much appreciated.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.04,0:08:04.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know what this is.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.17,0:08:07.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Home-brewed sake!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.54,0:08:08.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Alcohol?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.83,0:08:10.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Seems like!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.38,0:08:11.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Caught your attention fast, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:12.08,0:08:14.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Drink up and enjoy!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.33,0:08:18.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Pretty good, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.63,0:08:21.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is so good!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.21,0:08:26.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mochi-making caught on\Nas a form of winter exercise
Dialogue: 1,0:08:26.42,0:08:29.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,whenever the weather permitted.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.29,0:08:33.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,And the best mochi-maker among us was...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.92,0:08:35.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.46,0:08:37.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,...Gordon, the minotaur.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.92,0:08:40.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no need to use force.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.04,0:08:43.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Simply let the pestle fall\Nunder its own weight.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.58,0:08:45.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.63,0:08:49.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Farming Life in Another World 2.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.92,0:08:53.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:54.71,0:08:57.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wish to take you as my wife!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.92,0:09:00.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, who are you, exactly?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.50,0:09:03.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.75,0:09:08.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I am head of House Britoa of the\NDemonic Kingdom of Galgardo.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.54,0:09:10.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,My name is Grattz Britoa.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.83,0:09:12.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please, might I have your name?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.71,0:09:15.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I am Ronana.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.83,0:09:21.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,A minotaur woman from Village Two\Nand an imposing man in armor...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.38,0:09:23.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.25,0:09:26.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do forgive us for troubling you.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.08,0:09:31.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,The Great Tree Village?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.50,0:09:33.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,For what sudden business?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.25,0:09:37.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Relations with the village\Nare vital for our kingdom.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.04,0:09:39.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why should I not witness it for myself?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.63,0:09:40.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.63,0:09:42.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,My curiosity grows!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.00,0:09:43.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.46,0:09:47.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,He would have it no other way,\Nand this is what came of bringing him here.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.04,0:09:49.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Love at first sight, or so he says.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.79,0:09:53.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you the mayor of this village?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.75,0:09:56.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the name's Hiraku.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:56.25,0:09:57.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,And your conditions?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.75,0:09:58.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:58.75,0:10:02.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you require of me\Nto take Ronana as my wife!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.25,0:10:07.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,She says I must ask your permission.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:07.25,0:10:09.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can I have a moment?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:09.50,0:10:13.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that the normal way to take a wife here?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.29,0:10:15.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's not entirely not-normal.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.17,0:10:18.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,But parents often decide on\Ntheir child's spouse.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.83,0:10:22.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,At least for the first two or three wives.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.00,0:10:26.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,One day, a gallant man of nobility and\Na girl from a remote village came together...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.75,0:10:28.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here we go...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.38,0:10:30.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lovers from two different worlds.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:30.71,0:10:32.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,They are torn apart.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.58,0:10:36.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,As they escape on a dark moonless night...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.04,0:10:37.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,the evil hand of the mayor closes in!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.63,0:10:38.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,the evil hand of the mayor closes in!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.63,0:10:38.79,Q8,,0,0,0,,Roar!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.79,0:10:40.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,the evil hand of the mayor closes in!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.54,0:10:45.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's like a story out of fairy tales.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.88,0:10:49.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right. Let's all just say that made sense.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.00,0:10:55.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Look, I see that you're sincere,\Nbut what matters most is what she wants.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.21,0:10:59.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,If Ronana doesn't want to be married,\NI'm afraid I must refuse.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.63,0:11:02.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I need only make her say so?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.92,0:11:04.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,But you can't force her.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.58,0:11:07.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,No threats or commands.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:08.50,0:11:13.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Take your time, think it over,\Nand decide if he's right for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:13.25,0:11:15.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.08,0:11:19.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do that and you'll have\Nno complaints from me.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.17,0:11:24.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well then, Miss Ronana...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.50,0:11:25.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.71,0:11:30.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,What would you have me do?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:30.75,0:11:32.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:32.58,0:11:34.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,The perfect match can come out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.13,0:11:39.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Personally, I hope the best for them both.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.25,0:11:45.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,We've agreed to start by exchanging letters.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:45.50,0:11:49.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I cannot keep her from my mind.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.50,0:11:51.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,While I stand here,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:51.50,0:11:54.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,some other man might steal her away!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:54.33,0:11:57.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wish to be by her side!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.46,0:12:00.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I resign from my position\Namong the great generals!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.50,0:12:02.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Spare us this foolishness.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.63,0:12:05.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,You are commander of the kingdom's militia.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.25,0:12:09.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, and you cannot leave\Nsuch a post on a mere whim!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:09.92,0:12:12.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,My brother will serve in my stead.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.04,0:12:13.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,That is irresponsible!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.42,0:12:14.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I care not!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.67,0:12:15.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You are a disgrace!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.79,0:12:17.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I choose to live for love!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.42,0:12:19.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fine, I quit too!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:19.17,0:12:20.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Feel free!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:20.29,0:12:22.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I beg to differ.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.21,0:12:30.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well? How did we do?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.08,0:12:32.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,We made these pickles as well.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.46,0:12:35.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, I think you did excellently.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.25,0:12:38.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have that pot you needed fixed.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.13,0:12:39.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:42.46,0:12:44.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wish we had something\Nto really make this dish sing.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.21,0:12:48.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sing?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:48.46,0:12:50.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can food do that?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:50.00,0:12:51.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sing...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:51.00,0:12:51.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sing?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:51.75,0:12:53.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Waaa!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.08,0:12:54.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ooo hoo!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.71,0:12:59.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I meant that metaphorically.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.58,0:13:01.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I meant like seaweed-dark, thin...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:01.75,0:13:03.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,And how strong?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.88,0:13:05.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,How... strong?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:05.75,0:13:08.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,It comes from the sea, like kelp.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.21,0:13:10.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Usually wrapped around food.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.50,0:13:12.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,It wraps its food?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.25,0:13:13.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,How violent.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.00,0:13:18.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think it grows close to the seashore.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.25,0:13:22.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's harvested when it's cold, I think.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.50,0:13:27.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Some famous person on\Na TV show said as much.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:27.75,0:13:31.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,If it comes from the sea,\Nwe ought ask Michael.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:32.04,0:13:34.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,A trip to Shashaato it is, then!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.38,0:13:38.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then, a few days later...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.79,0:13:43.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you as always for\Nyour continued patronage.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:43.54,0:13:46.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry to bring you out here in this cold.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:46.04,0:13:47.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Spare it no thought!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.67,0:13:51.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I would travel through fire, water,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.54,0:13:53.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,and the icy northern winds to do trade.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.17,0:13:54.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,and the icy northern winds to do trade.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.17,0:13:54.38,Q8,,0,0,0,,Zoom!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:54.38,0:13:55.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,So cold!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.54,0:14:00.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now, we do not consume things\Nsuch as this seaweed you requested,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.79,0:14:06.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,so I am not entirely sure\NI have brought what you desire.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:06.54,0:14:09.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Truth is, I don't know\Nall that much about it either.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:09.79,0:14:11.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I'll give it a try.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.42,0:14:17.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,First, you use a knife to chop it.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:19.08,0:14:20.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,That should do it.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.04,0:14:23.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then you separate it in some water.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.25,0:14:27.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,And spread it in a wooden frame like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.96,0:14:30.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that enough?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.08,0:14:33.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,This almost looks like...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.58,0:14:36.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,the weeds that grow in the forest shade.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.50,0:14:37.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You have a point.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:38.46,0:14:41.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I suppose there's a reason\Nit's called seaweed.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.83,0:14:45.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Once it's spread thin,\Nyou remove the frame.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.08,0:14:46.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then we let it dry.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.88,0:14:49.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,We leave it like this?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:49.08,0:14:51.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,We should dry it outside.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.25,0:14:53.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, we'll leave this to our helping hands.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:53.83,0:14:55.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here I go, Tia.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.63,0:14:57.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whenever you're ready.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:57.38,0:14:59.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dry! Dry!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:59.50,0:15:01.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, moisture!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.88,0:15:04.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,The convenience of magic.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.58,0:15:07.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,We processed the seaweed you brought us.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.38,0:15:09.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is the same stuff?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.38,0:15:13.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is it fabric? Paper, maybe?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.88,0:15:16.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought it was to be food?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.83,0:15:19.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is it eaten as-is?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:19.00,0:15:20.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.96,0:15:23.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,First, you add heat,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:23.13,0:15:25.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,and crisp it up!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.54,0:15:28.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Apparently this makes it easier to digest.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:28.63,0:15:32.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd rather not upset their stomachs.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.04,0:15:34.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Has it taken on a new shade?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.71,0:15:37.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've never smelled anything like it.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.46,0:15:42.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,And once it's ready,\Nthis is the only way to go!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.13,0:15:44.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,What more could you ask for?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.29,0:15:50.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now this takes me back!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.92,0:15:52.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,How is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:52.17,0:15:54.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think I might cry.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:54.08,0:15:55.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is it that good?!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.25,0:15:58.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,The saltiness is a perfect match.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.04,0:15:59.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,At last, we get a taste!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:59.96,0:16:02.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love how easy it is to hold.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.58,0:16:09.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,We have roasted seaweed.\NWe have a brazier.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.42,0:16:10.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,It must be done!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.00,0:16:12.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fried mochi in seaweed!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:14.67,0:16:19.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mochi was good already, but now\Nit's crispy, crunchy, and flavorful!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.00,0:16:25.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good mayor, if you so wish it,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:25.33,0:16:30.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can see to it my people harvest\Nand process this seaweed for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:30.00,0:16:35.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,In exchange, I might ask you trade us\Nsome of the ingredients for this mochi.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.50,0:16:39.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's not something we can do right away,\Nas we'd need to grow more mochi rice.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.54,0:16:41.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I will raise the topic with my people.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.33,0:16:43.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Much appreciated.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.42,0:16:49.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,The ingredients keep for long and need\Nonly be cooked and dressed in sauce.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.08,0:16:52.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, this will be a fine money-maker.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:52.04,0:16:56.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've heard you have alcohol\Nmade from rice as well?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.46,0:16:58.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hands off our alcohol!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.63,0:17:00.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.50,0:17:02.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Farming...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:02.50,0:17:03.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Life...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.58,0:17:05.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,in Another World 2!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:09.92,0:17:12.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,We have rice. We have seaweed.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.75,0:17:18.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Something in my very soul calls out to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:18.42,0:17:20.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,"Make sushi!" it screams.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.25,0:17:22.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why must you fan it?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:22.29,0:17:26.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Honestly? No idea.\NBut this looks more the part.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:26.42,0:17:31.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,First, you take freshly made rice and\Nadd in vinegar mixed with salt and sugar.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:32.04,0:17:34.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then you wrap up the ingredients you have.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:35.08,0:17:38.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Many imagine nigiri\Nwhen they think of sushi.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.04,0:17:42.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,But the people of this world\Nare averse to raw fish.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.96,0:17:47.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,So instead, we're making thick sushi rolls\Nwith no raw ingredients.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.13,0:17:53.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,The dextrous mountain elves\Nmade our sushi mats for us.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.33,0:17:56.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Once you place the ingredients on the rice,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.92,0:17:58.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,you use the mat to roll it up.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:02.50,0:18:05.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Once it's wrapped, you cut it with a knife.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:07.88,0:18:10.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hrmm, it's tough to make these round.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.13,0:18:12.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Finished.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.58,0:18:15.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Impressive, honestly.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.46,0:18:17.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now to mix things up.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.17,0:18:20.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,We have mayonnaise,\Nso we'll make salad rolls.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.79,0:18:24.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,We don't have imitation crab meat,\Nso instead we'll use the real thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.54,0:18:26.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,What extravagance!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.38,0:18:28.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no way this doesn't taste incredible!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.08,0:18:35.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I just needed to check if it tasted okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.38,0:18:37.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,This one didn't roll well anyway, so...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:37.58,0:18:41.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, it appears I've improperly cut this.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.29,0:18:44.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,The angle is all off here.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:44.46,0:18:47.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,It is poor manners to sneak food that way.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.00,0:18:47.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.92,0:18:50.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow, so this is sushi?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.08,0:18:52.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,It looks so lovely.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:53.38,0:18:56.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,The tart smell put me off,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.29,0:18:58.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,but it goes surprisingly well.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.33,0:19:01.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,The vinegar might help it\Nkeep in lunch boxes.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:01.42,0:19:02.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.83,0:19:05.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Vinegar helps to eliminate bacteria.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.79,0:19:07.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,It does?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.88,0:19:10.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,And here they were,\Nhoping to ferment things.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.88,0:19:12.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll avenge you!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.00,0:19:21.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,After all that, winter is coming to an end.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.79,0:19:24.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,But even as the snow melts,\Nit does still get cold.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.13,0:19:29.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Most years we struggle to decide\Nwhen to start farming again, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:29.88,0:19:31.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's too early.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.50,0:19:35.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,From now on, we'll follow Igu's advice.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:36.13,0:19:39.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's something else I hope\Nto prepare before spring.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:39.63,0:19:42.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,You want to carry decorations around?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:42.42,0:19:45.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hanging explosives to set off around town?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.67,0:19:48.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Getting chased by rampaging bulls?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:48.21,0:19:50.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why would anyone do such?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.92,0:19:54.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,When you put it that way,\NI'm not exactly sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:54.67,0:19:56.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,What other customs are there?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.71,0:19:57.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:57.71,0:20:00.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now that we have Village Two,\NVillage Three, and all our new residents,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:01.04,0:20:02.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,A festival!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:02.13,0:20:04.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought maybe we could start\Na new festival for the village.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:04.92,0:20:05.29,Q8,,0,0,0,,It's all like, "Yay! Festival!"
Dialogue: 1,0:20:05.29,0:20:07.04,Q8,,0,0,0,,It's all like, "Yay! Festival!"
Dialogue: 1,0:20:05.29,0:20:07.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I tried telling them about
Dialogue: 1,0:20:07.04,0:20:08.92,Q8,,0,0,0,,and then more "Hooray!"
Dialogue: 1,0:20:07.04,0:20:08.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,all the festivals I knew.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:09.17,0:20:11.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Throwing tomatoes at each other?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:11.67,0:20:14.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Chasing cheese rolling down a hill?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:14.67,0:20:16.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Running around with pudding?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:16.92,0:20:21.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, despite your efforts,\Nwe just do not understand.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.54,0:20:26.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, it's my fault for giving\Nsuch weird examples.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.79,0:20:31.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,What sort of festivals are you familiar with?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.46,0:20:34.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,The sort to welcome in\Nthe new year or new harvest.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.83,0:20:37.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know some like that.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.46,0:20:40.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do you do at those festivals?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:40.08,0:20:43.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,We set up a pyopyo in the middle of town.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.00,0:20:45.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, not a moomoo?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:45.08,0:20:47.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't you mean the fall chomuchomu?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:47.58,0:20:49.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,What? No...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.54,0:20:51.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not following a word...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.50,0:20:55.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,But if this world has its own festivals,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:55.21,0:20:58.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,maybe I should let them plan one for me.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.83,0:21:05.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,In my homeland, pyopyo leaves the center\Nof town to attack the homes of the rich.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:05.13,0:21:07.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Pyopyo only digs a hole.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.29,0:21:09.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Moomoo attacks.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:09.79,0:21:11.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Attacks how?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:11.79,0:21:13.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Under cover.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.21,0:21:15.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Moomoo would never!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:15.25,0:21:17.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,They all have different interpretations.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:17.13,0:21:19.50,Q8,,0,0,0,,According to the official position-
Dialogue: 1,0:21:19.50,0:21:21.83,Q8,,0,0,0,,Who gave them the right\Nto decide anything?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:21.83,0:21:22.63,Q8,,0,0,0,,Moomoo stands for justice!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.63,0:21:24.33,Q8,,0,0,0,,Moomoo stands for justice!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.63,0:21:24.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,They all seem to disagree.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.33,0:21:26.50,Q8,,0,0,0,,Moomoo is all about the crazed sneak attacks.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.33,0:21:26.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Any chance we can combine this all into one?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.50,0:21:27.88,Q8,,0,0,0,,Moomoo is all about the crazed sneak attacks.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.50,0:21:27.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I doubt it.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.88,0:21:28.33,Q8,,0,0,0,,Moomoo defeats all evil!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.33,0:21:31.08,Q8,,0,0,0,,Moomoo defeats all evil!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.33,0:21:31.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Each region appears to have\Nquite different takes.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.08,0:21:31.92,Q8,,0,0,0,,Moomoo is the sneakiest attacker.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.08,0:21:31.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Each region appears to have\Nquite different takes.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.92,0:21:33.13,Q8,,0,0,0,,Moomoo is the sneakiest attacker.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:33.25,0:21:35.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,The weak-kneed moomoo is best.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:35.83,0:21:36.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.92,0:21:39.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nothing was coming together,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.13,0:21:43.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,so we had them each write down their\Nlocal traditions so we could draw lots.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.13,0:21:47.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay! Only one winner.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.08,0:21:50.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.50,0:21:52.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,How do they compete?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.54,0:21:55.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,By pitting fighting styles\Nagainst each other.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.33,0:21:57.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, not just a demonstration or something?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.67,0:22:00.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you picked something simple.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:00.17,0:22:03.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's get right to planning the competition.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.92,0:22:04.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.92,0:22:06.96,Q8,,0,0,0,,We cannot let this be anything but incredible!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.96,0:22:08.88,Q8,,0,0,0,,We cannot let this be anything but incredible!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.96,0:22:08.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not feeling great about picking\Nsomething so violent...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.88,0:22:10.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not feeling great about picking\Nsomething so violent...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.71,0:22:14.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,But maybe it will just be like\Na school sports day?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.13,0:22:15.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Kind of?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:47.54,0:23:50.92,Q18,,0,0,0,,Martial Arts Competition
